; A CiA 401 device with digital inputs and outputs only, of Cia401DeviceDescriptionTests: one
; logical device with 16 digital inputs and 16 digital outputs (the 8-bit objects of the first
; slice, 6000h-6008h and 6200h-6208h), no analog object, and the default PDOs of CiA 401-1 v3.1.0
; clauses 6.2.5 and 6.2.6. It is cia401.eds without its analog objects and their PDOs, and with
; the device type 1000h saying so (bits 16 and 17, CiA 401-1 clause 6.2.1). A device built with
; Cia401Device.FromDescription takes its function blocks from this file.

